Inter (Latin subset, weights 400, 600, 700, 800, and 900)
---------------------------------------------------------

Every distributed template package that names `Inter` in a `fontFamily` ships the
exact weights it renders with, so it produces the same typeface and the same text
metrics on a machine that has no Inter installed. (Two render-test fixtures still
name Inter without shipping it; they are listed under "Font family names
referenced without bundling a font" below.) Packages carry their own copies
because a motion package may only reference assets inside its own root — there is
no shared package-level asset store to point at.

