Synthetic audio fixture
-----------------------

Bundled file:
  templates/shellx-product-pack/audio-launch/assets/audio/shellx-launch-tone.wav

A deterministic synthetic sine tone generated locally with FFmpeg `lavfi`
(48 kHz, 16-bit, mono) and committed so offline audio-render tests need no
network or hosted generator. It contains no recorded or third-party audio. The
template declares this under `metadata.license` as `shellx-synthetic-audio`.


